SF0025S2001/ADOPTED
Page 1-line 6 After "rulemaking;" insert "requiring a report;".
Page 24-line 2 After "Section 3." insert "(a)".
Page 24-after line 6 Insert:
"(b) Upon promulgating a fee schedule for the electronic lien and title
system or not later than November 1, 2026, whichever is earlier, the department
of transportation shall report to the joint transportation, highways and
military affairs interim committee on the fee schedule that will be used to
implement the electronic lien and title system.". BRENNAN
SF0025S2002/ADOPTED
Page 3-line 5 After "system." insert "Transaction fees charged under
this subsection shall be charged to and paid by each
dealer, lender, lienholder, insurance company and
secured party that uses the electronic lien and title
system. No dealer, lender, lienholder, insurance
company or secured party that uses the electronic lien
and title system shall require a customer or other
person not normally engaged in the business or practice
of financing vehicles to pay any transaction fee
charged under this subsection.". ROTHFUSS
